    {
      "id": "build_in",
      "type": "compare",
      "role": "takeaway",
      "duration_s": 8,
      "narration": [
        "That's the bitter lesson: what we know loses to what scales.",
        "Don't build in how we think we think; build in search and learning.",
        "Those keep scaling with computation; hand-built knowledge levels off.",
        "We want agents that discover like we can.",
        "General methods that use computation win, by a large margin."
      ],
